  (197, 197, 12, 'BMW 3 Series 330i Sport Line', 'Clean BMW 3 Series with a full stamp book and no accident history. Air conditioning, cruise control and parking sensors are on board. Timing belt and water pump were replaced during the last major service. Private sale, therefore without warranty or right of return.', 28290, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '2241 hours', now() - interval '2241 hours'),
  (198, 198, 12, 'VW Passat 2.0 TDI Style', 'Carefully driven VW Passat in white, kept garaged and always serviced on time. Two keys, the full manual set and all service invoices are handed over. The engine oil and filter were changed just before the sale.', 18190, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '1478 hours', now() - interval '1478 hours'),
  (199, 199, 8, 'VW Passat 1.6 TDI Style', 'Carefully driven VW Passat in blue, kept garaged and always serviced on time. The interior is free of smoke and shows only light wear on the driver seat. Trade in of your current vehicle is possible after an on site valuation.', 20090, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '1466 hours', now() - interval '1466 hours'),
  (200, 200, 6, 'Hyundai i30 1.6 CRDi Prime', 'One owner Hyundai i30 in very presentable condition inside and out. The interior is free of smoke and shows only light wear on the driver seat. The exhaust system and clutch were checked and are in good order. Viewings are possible on weekdays and by appointment on Saturdays.', 6990, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '1187 hours', now() - interval '1187 hours'),
  (201, 201, 8, 'VW Polo 1.4 TSI Comfortline', 'Carefully driven VW Polo in silver, kept garaged and always serviced on time. Navigation, heated seats and a rear view camera are fitted. The engine oil and filter were changed just before the sale. Delivery within northern Germany can be arranged on request.', 12890, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '1594 hours', now() - interval '1594 hours'),
  (202, 202, 8, 'Opel Corsa 1.4 Elegance', 'Well maintained Opel Corsa with a complete service history from an authorised workshop. Bodywork is straight with only minor stone chips on the front bumper. Trade in of your current vehicle is possible after an on site valuation.', 14790, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '1978 hours', now() - interval '1978 hours'),
  (203, 203, 8, 'Tesla Model 3 Long Range AWD', 'Clean Tesla Model 3 with a full stamp book and no accident history. The vehicle runs on original wheels with tyres in good condition. A type 2 charging cable is included and the charging port shows no wear.', 40290, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '1578 hours', now() - interval '1578 hours'),
  (204, 204, 10, 'Mercedes-Benz A-Class A 180 d Avantgarde', 'Second owner Mercedes-Benz A-Class that has spent most of its life on longer motorway runs. Bodywork is straight with only minor stone chips on the front bumper. Private sale, therefore without warranty or right of return.', 8690, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '484 hours', now() - interval '484 hours'),
  (205, 205, 4, 'Opel Corsa 1.2 GS Line', 'Well maintained Opel Corsa with a complete service history from an authorised workshop. Navigation, heated seats and a rear view camera are fitted. Timing belt and water pump were replaced during the last major service.', 4890, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '1183 hours', now() - interval '1183 hours'),
  (206, 206, 5, 'Ford Focus 1.0 EcoBoost Trend', 'Second owner Ford Focus that has spent most of its life on longer motorway runs. New brake discs and pads were fitted at the most recent inspection. Trade in of your current vehicle is possible after an on site valuation.', 4990, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '2562 hours', now() - interval '2562 hours'),
  (207, 207, 14, 'VW Passat 1.4 TSI Comfortline', 'Reliable VW Passat that has been serviced strictly according to the manufacturer schedule. New brake discs and pads were fitted at the most recent inspection. The engine oil and filter were changed just before the sale. Trade in of your current vehicle is possible after an on site valuation.', 21090, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '2624 hours', now() - interval '2624 hours'),
  (208, 208, 5, 'BMW 5 Series 520i Sport Line', 'Tidy BMW 5 Series sold directly by its owner in Hamburg, ready to drive away. Bodywork is straight with only minor stone chips on the front bumper.', 47590, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '2622 hours', now() - interval '2622 hours'),
  (209, 209, 8, 'Škoda Fabia 1.4 TDI Ambition', 'Carefully driven Škoda Fabia in white, kept garaged and always serviced on time. Bodywork is straight with only minor stone chips on the front bumper. A test drive can be arranged at short notice.', 6890, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '2412 hours', now() - interval '2412 hours'),
  (210, 210, 15, 'VW Polo 1.4 TSI United', 'This VW Polo comes from long term ownership and has been looked after properly. Navigation, heated seats and a rear view camera are fitted. Timing belt and water pump were replaced during the last major service. Viewings are possible on weekdays and by appointment on Saturdays.', 19990, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '637 hours', now() - interval '637 hours'),
  (211, 211, 5, 'Mercedes-Benz C-Class C 200 Progressive', 'Well maintained Mercedes-Benz C-Class with a complete service history from an authorised workshop. Bodywork is straight with only minor stone chips on the front bumper. Trade in of your current vehicle is possible after an on site valuation.', 12690, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '909 hours', now() - interval '909 hours'),
  (212, 212, 14, 'Mercedes-Benz A-Class A 160 Exclusive', 'One owner Mercedes-Benz A-Class in very presentable condition inside and out. Navigation, heated seats and a rear view camera are fitted. The engine oil and filter were changed just before the sale. Private sale, therefore without warranty or right of return.', 24690, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '2153 hours', now() - interval '2153 hours'),
  (213, 213, 9, 'Audi A3 40 TFSI e Advanced', 'Well maintained Audi A3 with a complete service history from an authorised workshop. Air conditioning, cruise control and parking sensors are on board. A type 2 charging cable is included and the charging port shows no wear. Financing can be arranged directly through our partner bank.', 35690, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '1003 hours', now() - interval '1003 hours'),
  (214, 214, 15, 'Škoda Fabia 1.2 TSI Sportline', 'One owner Škoda Fabia in very presentable condition inside and out. New brake discs and pads were fitted at the most recent inspection. Timing belt and water pump were replaced during the last major service. Private sale, therefore without warranty or right of return.', 7890, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '80 hours', now() - interval '80 hours'),
  (215, 215, 12, 'BMW 5 Series 530e', 'Carefully driven BMW 5 Series in black, kept garaged and always serviced on time. The interior is free of smoke and shows only light wear on the driver seat. Sold with a fresh inspection and a fully documented history.', 32890, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '2301 hours', now() - interval '2301 hours'),
  (216, 216, 13, 'Audi A3 30 TFSI', 'Tidy Audi A3 sold directly by its owner in Kiel, ready to drive away. Bodywork is straight with only minor stone chips on the front bumper. The exhaust system and clutch were checked and are in good order.', 31790, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '86 hours', now() - interval '86 hours'),
  (217, 217, 10, 'VW Passat 1.4 GTE Highline', 'Carefully driven VW Passat in brown, kept garaged and always serviced on time. Navigation, heated seats and a rear view camera are fitted. Sold with a fresh inspection and a fully documented history.', 19390, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '240 hours', now() - interval '240 hours'),
  (218, 218, 9, 'Tesla Model 3 Long Range AWD', 'Clean Tesla Model 3 with a full stamp book and no accident history. The interior is free of smoke and shows only light wear on the driver seat. A type 2 charging cable is included and the charging port shows no wear. Viewings are possible on weekdays and by appointment on Saturdays.', 34390, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '918 hours', now() - interval '918 hours'),
  (219, 219, 9, 'Opel Corsa 1.3 CDTI Edition', 'Tidy Opel Corsa sold directly by its owner in Pinneberg, ready to drive away. Two keys, the full manual set and all service invoices are handed over. The exhaust system and clutch were checked and are in good order. A test drive can be arranged at short notice.', 5990, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '360 hours', now() - interval '360 hours'),
  (220, 220, 10, 'Tesla Model 3 Long Range AWD', 'Tidy Tesla Model 3 sold directly by its owner in Norderstedt, ready to drive away. Two keys, the full manual set and all service invoices are handed over. The high voltage battery was checked recently and its health is very good. Private sale, therefore without warranty or right of return.', 31790, 'ACTIVE', now() - interval '439 hours', now() - interval '439 hours');
